# Built by `go build` in loadgen/ — 19 MB, rebuilt in seconds.
loadgen/loadgen

# kine's own stderr per run. Useful while a run is being diagnosed, but each
# error line embeds the full 2 KB payload, so the set reached 116 MB across 26
# runs. The JSON result and the .indexes/.storage/.sizes files carry everything
# a later reader needs.
results/*.kine.log

# Throwaway keys for the local tier-2 apiserver, regenerated by hand (see
# run-apiserver.sh). They authenticate nothing outside this benchmark, but a
# private key and a bearer token do not belong in a repo regardless.
apiserver-certs/

# Built by `go build` in apiload/.
apiload/apiload

# Built by `go build` in loadgen2/ (open-loop driver).
loadgen2/loadgen2
